The red bus goes through Mumbai city.
There is heavy traffic on the road.
Therefore, the bus moves very slowly.
I look outside the window.
Now, the bus reaches the metro station.
The metro station is very big.
It is a glass building.
The bus stops at the station.
The door of the bus opens.
I hold my bag.
I carefully alight from the bus.
Many people also alight from the bus.
There is a large crowd on the street.
All the people walk towards the entrance.
I also need to get to the metro station.
I walk with the people.
Today, I am going by the metro train.
